# External Python dependency closure for shared model-profile serving.
#
# Versions define the external dependency closure for the CUDA 13.4.1 model
# serving runtime. Foundation, custom application, InstantTensor, and NCCL wheel
# assets are supplied by their own immutable bundles and therefore do not
# appear in this list. NVIDIA ModelOpt is an official pure-Python PyPI wheel.
# CUDA Python 13.3.1 is intentional: NVIDIA PyTorch 26.08
# ships that binding release with the CUDA 13.4.1 toolkit.
